{"2838380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battle Room", "steam_appid": 2838380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIATURE TOYS &amp; MASSIVE ROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Room</strong> is a free-to-play multiplayer shooter where fun-sized toys fight across oversized everyday rooms. Familiar places become massive arenas, filled with characters of different sizes, styles and advantages — including one that is completely two-dimensional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOG FEED: OWN THE SPOTLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your biggest moments come alive through <strong>Fog Feed</strong>: signature celebrations that put your name at the top of every rival’s screen and make your best plays impossible to miss. Play solo or in team modes through matchmaking, or create custom matches with your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep competing to collect outfits, dash styles and Fog Feed celebrations, then combine them in countless ways to make every appearance unmistakably your own. Be ready for unexpected surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FPS OR TPS? YOUR CALL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in first-person or third-person and switch between them during the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR ABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character brings a surprising ability of their own, from a bubble gum pop to a powerful football charge or a fast rolling attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stamina, use your abilities at the right moment, discover special weapons, and climb to stronger firepower as you score more kills in the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIATURE TOYS &amp; MASSIVE ROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Room</strong> is a free-to-play multiplayer shooter where fun-sized toys fight across oversized everyday rooms. Familiar places become massive arenas, filled with characters of different sizes, styles and advantages — including one that is completely two-dimensional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/ae7ad0794add9e450189b1221f7c4e39.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOG FEED: OWN THE SPOTLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your biggest moments come alive through <strong>Fog Feed</strong>: signature celebrations that put your name at the top of every rival’s screen and make your best plays impossible to miss. Play solo or in team modes through matchmaking, or create custom matches with your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep competing to collect outfits, dash styles and Fog Feed celebrations, then combine them in countless ways to make every appearance unmistakably your own. Be ready for unexpected surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/20c2db81cf354dc9d125cc701d59e51a.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FPS OR TPS? YOUR CALL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in first-person or third-person and switch between them during the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/532c6a47127610a8c1e55f08eacf3b39.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR ABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character brings a surprising ability of their own, from a bubble gum pop to a powerful football charge or a fast rolling attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stamina, use your abilities at the right moment, discover special weapons, and climb to stronger firepower as you score more kills in the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.poster.avif?t=1787652490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.webm?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/5b98e037f03bc788ffa727cef7721d9d.mp4?t=1787652490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "What would you do for us? Battle Room is a free-to-play, fast-paced multiplayer shooter where every second counts. Stars swap FPS/TPS, and are masters of their unique abilities. Climb to stronger firepower and observe well to find yourself at the top. It's time to break free and be here with us!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/9416994f44243eb42c62d76e03e47c73f60ee886/header.jpg?t=1787652490", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/b1f4bab6025a5276367db569ef85845335fca055/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787652490", "capsule_imagev5": 